cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "BIOAI: a contamination-aware gut-vaginal strain-sharing pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, contamination-aware pipeline that detects whether two body
  sites in the same individual share an identical bacterial strain (inStrain
  popANI), separates true translocation from cross-swab contamination via a
  community-similarity check, and grounds calls with a within- vs
  between-person null.
type: software
authors:
